{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_44987","headline":"春日杼山寄赠李员外纵 · 皎然","name":"春日杼山寄赠李员外纵","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"南山唯与北山邻，古树连拳伴我身。\n黄鹤有心多不住，白云无事独相亲。\n闲持竹锡深看水，嬾系麻衣出见人。\n欲掇幽芳聊赠远，郎官那赏石门春。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皎然","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_44987.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_44987","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}